WEBVTT

00:39:59.681 --> 00:40:04.919
The achievements
that we were able to accomplish

00:40:04.943 --> 00:40:06.110
were amazing,

00:40:06.134 --> 00:40:08.443
and people did really incredible work

00:40:08.467 --> 00:40:12.926
and people went from one day
being very proud and excited

00:40:12.950 --> 00:40:16.511
to say they worked at the company
when they were at a party,

00:40:16.535 --> 00:40:20.135
to the next day maybe not so much.

00:40:20.653 --> 00:40:22.237
And I think that was really sad,

00:40:22.261 --> 00:40:24.592
because I think so much
of our personal identity

00:40:24.616 --> 00:40:26.260
and our personal brand,

00:40:26.284 --> 00:40:29.343
which ultimately shapes our career,

00:40:29.367 --> 00:40:34.460
is connected to where we work,